{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/Stefan_3D_AI/status/2104981826888675532","id":"2104981826888675532","text":"New Open-Source AI Animator: Text-to-Animation for Humans, Animals, Creatures, Robots & More\n\nUniMate generates motion from text prompts for rigged 3D characters. Describe an action and turn it into animation.\n\nHighlights:\n• One model, different skeletons—no separate retraining for each rig.\n• Generate transitions between existing keyframes.\n• Edit motion with text while keeping selected joints unchanged.\n• Extend animations with a sequence of prompts.\n• Export animated meshes as FBX and GLB.\n• MIT-licensed code + downloadable preview weights.\n\nhttps://github.com/Friedrich-M/UniMate","raw_text":{"text":"New Open-Source AI Animator: Text-to-Animation for Humans, Animals, Creatures, Robots & More\n\nUniMate generates motion from text prompts for rigged 3D characters. Describe an action and turn it into animation.\n\nHighlights:\n• One model, different skeletons—no separate retraining for each rig.\n• Generate transitions between existing keyframes.\n• Edit motion with text while keeping selected joints unchanged.\n• Extend animations with a sequence of prompts.\n• Export animated meshes as FBX and GLB.\n• MIT-licensed code + downloadable preview weights.\n\nhttps://t.co/iy9zRxWfep","display_text_range":[0,574],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[283,306],"id":"2104981708718448640","display":"pic.x.com/v7mTo7A4MQ","original":"https://t.co/v7mTo7A4MQ","replacement":"https://x.com/Stefan_3D_AI/status/2104981826888675532/video/1"},{"type":"url","indices":[551,574],"original":"https://t.co/iy9zRxWfep","replacement":"https://github.com/Friedrich-M/UniMate","display":"github.com/Friedrich-M/Un…"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"Stefan_3D_AI","url":"https://x.com/Stefan_3D_AI","id":"1381936011488411648","followers":12767,"following":26,"likes":860,"media_count":414,"name":"Stefan 3D AI","description":"Stefan Vaskevich: 3D AI Explorer.\nS